            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Верни переменную из этой функции.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" brightness = \" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" brightness;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getBrightness());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"67\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>brightness</code>.</p></body></html>"
