            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Что выводит этот код в консоль?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAirDate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;TV show aired in: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + year;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = displayAirDate(\" /><text value=\"1990\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"TV show aired in: 1990\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>TV show aired in: 1990</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ничего не отображается в консоли</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1990</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>TV show aired in: 1990</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Представь, что вызов изменен на <code>displayAirDate(2000)</code>. Что сохранится в <code>text</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAirDate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;TV show aired in: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + year;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = displayAirDate(\" /><text value=\"1990\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"TV show aired in: 1990\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">TV show aired in: 2000</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">TV show aired in: 1990</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">2000</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери TV show aired in: 2000.</p></body></html>",
